<section class="narrow page-head"><span class="eyebrow">EDUCATIONAL TOOL</span><h1>BMI Calculator</h1><p>Enter height and weight to calculate a basic BMI estimate.</p><form class="form-card" id="bmi-form"><label>Height (cm)<input type="number" name="height" min="100" max="230" step="0.1" required></label><label>Weight (kg)<input type="number" name="weight" min="25" max="300" step="0.1" required></label><button class="btn primary" type="submit">Calculate BMI</button><div id="bmi-result" aria-live="polite"></div></form><p class="disclaimer">BMI is a screening measure only. It does not diagnose health conditions and does not account for all differences in body composition, age or individual health.</p></section>
